{"_v":3,"id":"blithe-spirit-west-end-2021","cat":"west-end","cs":66.78,"rc":5,"bd":{"positive":1,"mixed":3,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Clive Davis","o":"The Times (UK)","s":75,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.co.uk/article/blithe-spirit-review-saunders-kicks-ass-as-madame-arcati-2x7283qhj","q":"Above all, her comic timing is impeccable."},{"cn":"Anya Ryan","o":"The Independent","s":69,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/independentpremium/culture/blithe-spirit-review-jennifer-saunders-b1924688.html","q":"The best moments come when Saunders is centre-stage, [though] the rest of the cast do ... hold their own."},{"cn":"Tom Wicker","o":"Time Out London","s":65,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/blithe-spirit-review","q":"It's an off-the-peg 'Ab Fab' sketch: funny but a little too familiar."},{"cn":"Gary Naylor","o":"The Arts Desk","s":73,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://theartsdesk.com/comedy-theatre/blithe-spirit-harold-pinter-theatre-review-amusing-if-dated-revival-coward-classic","q":"This play's revival is, on balance, a good thing for everyone involved."},{"cn":"Mark Shenton","o":"London Theatre","s":49,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/review-blithe-spirit-starring-jennifer-saunders-at-the-duke-of-yorks-theatre","q":"Eyre strains too much for comic eccentricity, and as a result, the comedy threatens to congeal instead of being liberated by it."}]}